work dictionary_is_small_and_unlabelled
  target_plane run4_institutional_fabric
  priority 5.5
  reason The trainer is real and the dictionaries it wrote are fitted to recorded residuals, but to very few: 76 vectors in the certification run and 149 in the one kept under dictionaries/. Recording ran at about a quarter of a token a second with the machine out of swap. No feature has a label or a danger tag, so the gate still gates nothing; labelling needs someone to look at what each feature fires on.

work moq_self_test_does_not_relay
  target_plane run4_institutional_fabric
  priority 4.5
  reason The native moq self-test proves a QUIC session and a refused subscribe. The archived one relayed a payload from a publisher to a subscriber, using Python peers. A native publish and an authorised subscribe would restore that.

work capability_bar_is_what_the_frappe_apps_can_do
  target_plane run4_institutional_fabric
  priority 8.5
  reason Direction from the operator, 2026-10-10: maturity is that the estate natively does what the ERPNext-family applications are capable of, and well past it. Frappe is the shorthand for that bar, not something to depend on. What is measured today is narrower: the compiler holds 1,152 record types from nine applications; 301 are tied to an estate organ, all of them presentation (list or space), and 851 to none. Nothing yet maps what those applications do (raise an invoice, take a payment, reconcile, quote, follow up) to the organ that does it and to a run that proves it. A first baseline is now in packs/capability-bar/crosswalk.yaff: 44 module rows counted from the inventory and 15 acts checked against the organs, of which 5 are proven, 3 partial, 2 have a verb nothing real has gone through, 1 is blocked and 4 are absent. The accounting core (payment, quote, ledger, tax, stock, payroll) is the absent part.

work tone_profile_needs_egemaps
  target_plane run4_institutional_fabric
  priority 4.0
  reason Without OpenSMILE the tone organ extracts and compares with the estate's own voice features and refuses to build a profile, whose dimensions are defined on eGeMAPS names. A profile defined on the native set, or OpenSMILE installed, would close it.

work tel_has_not_reached_a_telephone
  target_plane run5_recursive_external
  priority 6.5
  reason Tel is certified against a real FreeSWITCH that has no trunk: a call is placed, exists in the switch, is recorded and is hung up, all on loopback. Ringing a telephone needs a carrier account in the switch's external profile, and none was looked for: reading the estate's credential store was refused. The operator offered a number to test with on 2026-10-10. send-sms, send-mms and listen have not been run against the switch at all.

work switch_is_installed_by_hand
  target_plane run4_institutional_fabric
  priority 4.0
  reason Homebrew could not pour the FreeSWITCH bottle for lack of space (it is 412 MB, mostly hold music), so the switch was unpacked from the bottle without its sounds, its library paths corrected by hand and the keg linked. It runs and Homebrew lists its files, but it has no install receipt, and anything that plays a sound file will not find one.

